\f3\fs26 The water treatment and filtration facility for management and executive level professionals was a completely separate system to the rest of the primary trade dominion. The water was filtered, sterilised, oxygenated and piped to every executive and management level home and business to ensure the elite had the cleanest drinking water in the world. The facility was high security, but a company of Elvis operatives penetrated security and dropped the \'91Anti T-virus innoculant\'92 into the water and left before anyone even noticed.\
The result was profound, but again unnoticed. The executive and management elite, level 5 and above, were immune to the Hybrid T-Virus.\
